{"candidateAnswer":"Renewable energy and clean water projects","evidence":"[D22:10 | 5:33 pm on 26 August, 2023] Jolene: I'm keen on two projects in particular. One is focused on developing renewable energy, like solar, to help communities and reduce dependence on non-renewables. \n[D22:12 | 5:33 pm on 26 August, 2023] Jolene: The other is finding ways to supply clean water to those with limited access. Both align with my beliefs about sustainability and assisting those in need. I still have so much to figure out before beginning, but I'm up for the challenge.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c3470689-6e35-549e-b18b-3291b585fa5f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:807330fd9b1e58e611be819027bbed36e111de9fe9802eab6f17cef0c42ef311","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What projects is Jolene planning for next year?","referenceAnswer":"developing renewable energy finding ways to supply clean water to those with limited access","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"807330fd9b1e58e611be819027bbed36e111de9fe9802eab6f17cef0c42ef311"}}]}